  "question": {
    "text": "For the following three reactions $a, b$ and $c$, equilibrium constants are given:\na. $\\mathrm{CO}(\\mathrm{g})+\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}(\\mathrm{g}) \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{CO}_2(\\mathrm{~g})+\\mathrm{H}_2(\\mathrm{~g}) ; \\quad \\mathrm{K}_1$\nb. $\\mathrm{CH}_4(\\mathrm{~g})+\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}(\\mathrm{g}) \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{CO}(\\mathrm{g})+3 \\mathrm{H}_2(\\mathrm{~g}) ; \\quad \\mathrm{K}_2$\nc. $\\mathrm{CH}_4(\\mathrm{~g})+2 \\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}(\\mathrm{g}) \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{CO}_2(\\mathrm{~g})+4 \\mathrm{H}_2(\\mathrm{~g}) ; \\mathrm{K}_3$\nWhich of the following relations is correct?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "xlvhP",
      "text": "\n$\\mathrm{K}_1 \\sqrt{\\mathrm{K}_2}=\\mathrm{K}_3$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "0VDZI",
      "text": "\n$\\mathrm{K}_2 \\mathrm{~K}_3=\\mathrm{K}_1$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "DOr75",
      "text": "\n$\\mathrm{K}_3=\\mathrm{K}_1 \\mathrm{~K}_2$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JdneV",
      "text": "\n$\\mathrm{K}_3 \\cdot \\mathrm{K}_2^3=\\mathrm{K}_1^2$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Equation (c) = equation (a) + equation (b)\nThus $\\mathrm{K}_3=\\mathrm{K}_1 \\cdot \\mathrm{K}_2$",
    "image": null
  },
